<item><title>Guinea-Bissau delays presidential and parliamentary elections until 2028</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-delays-presidential-and-parliamentary-45480a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-delays-presidential-and-parliamentary-45480a/</guid><category>Guinea-Bissau</category><description>A decree moves the vote from 6 December to 26 November 2028 after the presidency said election preparations lacked sufficient resources.</description><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:58:08 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" length="36788" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea-Bissau sets presidential and legislative elections for 2028</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-sets-presidential-and-legislative-elections-8f0fea/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-sets-presidential-and-legislative-elections-8f0fea/</guid><category>Guinea-Bissau</category><description>Transition President Horta Inta-a cited missing technical, material and financial conditions for the vote, originally scheduled for 6 December 2026.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:14:35 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-sets-presidential-and-legislative-elections-8f0fea/share.jpg" length="43316" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-sets-presidential-and-legislative-elections-8f0fea/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea-Bissau hospital offers free prostate screening on two dates</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-hospital-offers-free-prostate-screening-on-5aae01/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-hospital-offers-free-prostate-screening-on-5aae01/</guid><category>Guinea-Bissau</category><description>The National Simão Mendes Hospital is providing consultations and screening tests to the public and health workers as part of Novembro Azul.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 18:07:15 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" length="36788" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Guinea-Bissau parties demand election calendar a year after coup</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-parties-demand-election-calendar-a-year-after-d92f49/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/gw/guinea-bissau-parties-demand-election-calendar-a-year-after-d92f49/</guid><category>Guinea-Bissau</category><description>The government and electoral commission postponed the vote planned for 6 December 2026, citing a lack of technical and logistical conditions.</description><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:57:50 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" length="36788" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/gw.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
